/* Win32 and Wine structures whose layout the LLP64 wasm64 PE side must
 * share with x64 programs (test/wine64/layout.test.js). Each type is named
 * once; the test dumps clang's record layouts for wasm64 (GexLLP64) and for
 * x86_64-w64-mingw32 and compares them. */
